[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3167577448","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109420#issuecomment-3167577448","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109420","id":3167577448,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc68zWVo","user":{"login":"dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek","html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-08T11:38:25Z","updated_at":"2025-08-08T11:38:25Z","body":"> But I'm not sure what's better, storing 30 MB of jsons instead of downloading it on each validation.\r\n\r\nIf we stored them compressed, they would be much smaller? Although, I'm also unsure if this is worth doing, even if the size increase was much less","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3167577448/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3167859187","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109420#issuecomment-3167859187","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109420","id":3167859187,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc680bHz","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-08T13:10:05Z","updated_at":"2025-08-08T13:10:05Z","body":"I think it's good to balance the benefits and drawbacks\r\n\r\nBenefits:\r\n* Protects against GitHub bugs and also provides some degree of speed saving instead of downloading\r\n\r\nDrawbacks:\r\n* Adds an additional point of potential loss of sync, the need to sync on the godot-cpp side can already cause frustration and this would be a third point of potential failure\r\n* The failure state that causes this case has been pretty rare so might not be worth it\r\n\r\nI think in the end it might be a net positive, but we might be trying to fix a very rare edge case that has a fix that will rarely if ever be needed, so we might want to instead add a check that informs about errors in downloading instead to help diagnose it, and if it occurs again in the future we can look at adding local copies","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3167859187/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3167866305","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109420#issuecomment-3167866305","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109420","id":3167866305,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc680c3B","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-08T13:12:27Z","updated_at":"2025-08-08T13:12:27Z","body":"Note that the data is downloading fine now for the last few hours, so it was a temporary issue that has gone away again (and hasn't happened recently at least)","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3167866305/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3167868268","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109420#issuecomment-3167868268","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109420","id":3167868268,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc680dVs","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-08T13:13:08Z","updated_at":"2025-08-08T13:13:08Z","body":"> Adds an additional point of potential loss of sync, the need to sync on the godot-cpp side can already cause frustration and this would be a third point of potential failure\r\n\r\nIt's not an issue in the case, these files are only generated for each major stable release, and can never change. So the only sync necessary is adding a new one on release, but we already need to add `.expected` file on release, so it can be done in one step.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3167868268/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3167882238","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109420#issuecomment-3167882238","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109420","id":3167882238,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc680gv-","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-08T13:18:02Z","updated_at":"2025-08-08T13:34:59Z","body":"Sure but it's still a thing to track and I'm not convinced this is going to be needed, in this case it broke for little over two hours (it started some time between 7:14 and 7:29 UTC, and was resolved by 9:37 UTC, but no CI was run between 8:35 and 9:37 so it's hard to pinpoint when it was actually fixed)\r\n\r\nI'd suggest something like the way we fetch Vulkan on macOS with a warning if it fails to download and a soft failure on the version(s) that fail to download and just running the rest of the tests, so we can make note of it and re-run later to verify, that way we can also gauge if this is likely to be more regular (which I doubt given that it hasn't really happened before as far as I can recall)","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3167882238/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3168617717","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109420#issuecomment-3168617717","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109420","id":3168617717,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc683UT1","user":{"login":"dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek","html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-08T16:36:56Z","updated_at":"2025-08-08T16:36:56Z","body":"In a similar vein to @AThousandShips suggestion, what if we kept MD5 hashes of the files in the repo, and if the files don't match the hash we give a warning? That way we can prevent temporary issues from the download \"succeeding\" but giving the wrong contents","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3168617717/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3168702342","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109420#issuecomment-3168702342","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109420","id":3168702342,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc683o-G","user":{"login":"Bromeon","id":708488,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwODQ4OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/708488?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bromeon","html_url":"https://github.com/Bromeon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bromeon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bromeon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bromeon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bromeon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bromeon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bromeon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bromeon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bromeon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bromeon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-08T16:56:33Z","updated_at":"2025-08-08T16:57:16Z","body":"Has this occurred many times? If this particular behavior is a one-off event, it may not be worth introducing special measures to circumvent it.\r\n\r\n(Personally I'd still prefer lightweight measures like MD5 over keeping local copies of the JSON files; I agree that duplicating those has quite a few downsides. But even that may not be necessary :thinking:)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3168702342/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3168715415","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109420#issuecomment-3168715415","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109420","id":3168715415,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc683sKX","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-08T17:02:31Z","updated_at":"2025-08-08T17:02:31Z","body":"I've not seen this happen before at least not in the last months","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3168715415/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3800802070","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109420#issuecomment-3800802070","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109420","id":3800802070,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7ii6MW","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-26T17:33:34Z","updated_at":"2026-01-26T17:35:50Z","body":"I really don't want to add 2M lines of code to the repo.\r\n\r\nWe could revive [godot-headers](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-headers/tree/master) which was used for GDNative and put headers for stable releases there.\r\n\r\nI have all 4.x stable release locally so I can update it with commits for each minor and patch release.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3800802070/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3800818691","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109420#issuecomment-3800818691","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109420","id":3800818691,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7ii-QD","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-26T17:37:41Z","updated_at":"2026-01-26T17:37:41Z","body":"> We could revive [godot-headers](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-headers/tree/master) which was used for GDNative and put headers for stable releases there.\r\n>\r\n> I have all 4.x stable release locally so I can update it with commits for each minor and patch release.\r\n\r\nThis makes sense, and we'll only need to change the link in the main repo.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3800818691/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3800861255","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109420#issuecomment-3800861255","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109420","id":3800861255,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7ijIpH","user":{"login":"dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek","html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-26T17:47:26Z","updated_at":"2026-01-26T17:47:26Z","body":"> We could revive [godot-headers](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-headers/tree/master) which was used for GDNative and put headers for stable releases there.\r\n\r\nHaving a separate repo for the JSON files sounds like a good idea, but I don't know about using [godot-headers](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-headers/tree/master) specifically. Other than `gdextension_interface.h`, we don't really provide headers any more, so it would make more sense to me as a new repo.\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3800861255/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengi